<body>

<div class="app">

 <header>

 <h1>Answer Evidence Balance Board</h1>

 <p>Paste → Split → Audit → Export</p>

 </header>



 <section class="paste-section" aria-label="Paste draft answer">

 <label for="paste-input">Draft Answer</label>

 <textarea id="paste-input" placeholder="Paste your draft answer here…&#10;&#10;Tip: Paragraphs separated by blank lines become individual cards. You can also edit cards directly after splitting."></textarea>

 <div class="paste-actions">

 <button class="btn primary" id="btn-split" type="button">Split into Cards</button>

 <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-clear" type="button">Clear All</button>

 <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-demo" type="button">Load Demo</button>

 </div>

 </section>



 <section class="cards-section" id="cards-section" aria-label="Claim, evidence, and helpfulness cards" role="list">

 <div class="empty-state" id="empty-state" role="status">

 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="002424" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M142H6a22000-22v16a2200022h12a220002-2V8z"></path><polyline points="142148208"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="1099989"></polyline></svg>

 <p>No cards yet. Paste a draft and click <strong>Split into Cards</strong>.</p>

 </div>

 </section>



 <details class="flags-panel" id="flags-panel" aria-label="Balance flags">

 <summary><span id="flags-count">0</span> Balance Flags</summary>

 <div class="flags-list" id="flags-list" role="list" aria-live="polite"></div>

 </details>



 <details class="checklist-panel" id="checklist-panel" aria-label="Source needed checklist">

 <summary>Source-Needed Checklist</summary>

 <div class="checklist-items" id="checklist-items" role="list"></div>

 </details>



 <section class="export-section" aria-label="Export cleaned answer">

 <div class="export-preview empty" id="export-preview" aria-live="polite" role="textbox" readonly>Export preview appears here after analysis.</div>

 <div class="export-actions">

 <button class="btn primary" id="btn-copy" type="button">Copy Clean Answer</button>

 <button class="btn ghost" id="btn-download" type="button">Download .txt</button>

